category: Math
requires: cygwin libgfortran5 libgomp1 libopenmpi40 libopenmpifh40
sdesc: "Library of Iterative Solvers for Linear Systems (runtime)"
ldesc: "Lis, a Library of Iterative Solvers for linear systems, is a scalable parallel
